   "updated": 1791906203453,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "① Workers watch servers\nPing every few seconds. Dead\nserver → start a new one and\nput it behind the load\nbalancer.",
   "originalText": "① Workers watch servers\nPing every few seconds. Dead\nserver → start a new one and\nput it behind the load\nbalancer.",
