   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "④ Election\nWorkers pick one of themselves\n(Bully: biggest alive ID\nwins). Nobody outside the\ngroup is needed — the chain\nends here.",
   "originalText": "④ Election\nWorkers pick one of themselves\n(Bully: biggest alive ID\nwins). Nobody outside the\ngroup is needed — the chain\nends here.",
