   "updated": 1791906203453,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "⑥ In practice\nDon't write it. Take a lease\n(a lock with an expiry) in\netcd / ZooKeeper / Consul.\nRenewals = heartbeat, expiry =\ntimeout.",
   "originalText": "⑥ In practice\nDon't write it. Take a lease\n(a lock with an expiry) in\netcd / ZooKeeper / Consul.\nRenewals = heartbeat, expiry =\ntimeout.",
